<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  -----			 O/N = 2.56%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  -----			 T/N = 2.56%</p>
<p>		   Nov 27, 1996			Nov 26, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  5.11%	1 month forward =  5.11%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  7.15%	2 month forward =  7.77%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  7.27%	3 month forward =  7.73%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  8.09%	4 month forward =  8.35%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  8.24%	5 month forward =  8.52%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  8.23%	6 month forward =  8.57%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
